On a day as red as today with the DeepSeek news it’s still refreshing to be able to bag some chedda cheese as I swoop up shares with my roomba and get into long dated calls as cyber Monday came early.

But also to recognize that Allie signaled in the OA arena that Apple would survive the storm. After a quick glance at the deltas and Greeks I decided to hope in and turn a quick 60% gain.

Now, don’t blindly follow someone’s signal into a trade. Look at the data. Give yourself some pause. Track the 5 min candle and look at where the volume and liquidity is going. Cross check with QD and make your assumption accordingly. Then enter, exit, and rinse and repeat!

