Stairway to heaven. Enter low, exit high. Buy low, sell high.

The strategy is to know when the bottom is reached and then to enter. And then when to sell. Remember trading is about at anticipating that there will be someone else who buys at a higher premium than you trying to outbid you.

Masterclass dot com has a great class on trading, and understanding the markets. Understanding macroeconomics by Bridge water and more. Check out the classes on that platform if you’re keen to learn more about trading on the Wall Street level. 

The market makers already have it priced in with hedging, long dated put walls and calls to protect themselves from big losses. As a retail traversing heavy and or lite one to three coins is how you can make trading a hobby that will enable you to put some extra chedda cheese on your spaghetti bolognese come Christmas time.

