I’ve been sleeping with being active with posts but this week I hit the 100k mark in my trading portfolio journey. Afterhours and OA team have helped me develop my own trading edge where I do a mixture between exercising long dated calls when it’s discount season (red days) and or exchanging the contract for the premium gains intrinsically and extrinsically ITM, ATM, OTM.

This year I exercised cheap $HIMS contracts at 15 - 100 shares, $LUNR at $6 a piece and $NVDA 100c when it dipped at 98 in August. I like investing in companies that Afterhours enables me to help me form my own DD. And products that I believe will do well on their own. For instance $HOOD we saw two amazing trades lined up this year. Long dated calls for the HOOD event when they announced Legend and the most recent earnings. @sirjack signaled the HOOD legend event and tbh it’s a sturdy trading product with amazing numbers.

I did not exercise my $U $20 since Unity has been struggling to climb above $20 and hold and it’s cheaper to buy on the open market. So those contracts were sold at a 10% gain.

So what am I investing in currently, or putting leap calls towards? $RXRX, $TEM, $ACHR are my current things I’m eyeing. As an avid snowboarder I’m also investing in $MTN as they’re the Google (monopoly) of ski resort management (epic pass - Vail resorts) and pay a 5% dividend. Here’s to the next 100k and beyond currently trading at a discount.

